From a31ae82e4a9e94577de4578901cdb09ea8c680a4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Gustavo Ferreira <97403833+gustavo-ferreira03@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 19:41:58 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] Keep the browser request hook working for URLs that Node
 cannot parse

Chromium requests some URLs that the WHATWG parser rejects, such as a
host with an escaped space. browserRequestHeaders called new URL() on
them, so the onBeforeSendHeaders listener threw before it called back,
and the main process stopped answering.

Closes #3775
